Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:15:47 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Spatiand: built for Android libc: files chosen in Spatiand's
 own chooser

There is no desktop portal on Android to ask, as there is on the Deck: a page's file input, Save as,
a folder to upload or an extension to load ask Spatiand's chooser instead, a window of the room
(libspatiand-choose.so, beside SpatiMesh in the APK), run as a program that writes what was chosen.
It starts where the page asked, else where the last choice was, else Downloads, else Android's own
Download folder where Spatiand may read it.
